<title>USA: Toyota March US vehicle sales up 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Toyota March US vehicle sales up 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Mar 1-31, 1997     Mar 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    62,755	    60,297	     +4.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  13,800	    14,294	     -3.5</p>
<p> Import Car		20,955	    21,661	     -3.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	    24,241	    19,708	    +23.0</p>
<p> Total Vehicles	 121,751	   115,960	     +5.0</p>
<p>		 Jan 1-Mar 31, 1997 Jan 1-Mar 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   162,261	   124,492	    +32.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  34,442	    33,152	     +5.3</p>
<p> Import Car		57,208	    57,032	     +1.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	    60,495	    46,356	    +32.2</p>
<p> Total Vehicles	 314,406	   261,032	    +22.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 76 for year to date vs 77 in year ago.</p>
</text>
